# City Racer

Clean web version of the City Racer open-world racing game.

## Files
- `index.html` — game page
- `style.css` — game interface and mobile controls
- `game.js` — driving, race checkpoints, nitro, garage and upgrades

## Run
Open `index.html` in a browser, or publish the folder with GitHub Pages.

This package contains only the City Racer project. Omongin AI files are not included.
